    "detailed_description": "<h1>OUR OTHER GAME!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><i>Immerse yourself in a world where every step you take could be your last, where the tension grows with every passing moment.  The IFU invites you to guide your character, Alexander, through loops of uncharted mysteries and dark secrets.</i><br><br><strong>Discover a story that takes your breath away:</strong>.<br>You are Alexander, a computer programmer who finds himself at the center of an unimaginable nightmare. Your reality turns into a struggle for survival when you follow an invitation that promises to be the gateway to a new life, but becomes the entrance to hell. Meet the mystical Droseries and uncover Dr. Hatcher's story, which is shrouded in sinister secrets.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666080/extras/5bd01b8a0af797589b47f0b54f519816.poster.avif?t=1729702820\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666080/extras/5bd01b8a0af797589b47f0b54f519816.webm?t=1729702820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666080/extras/5bd01b8a0af797589b47f0b54f519816.mp4?t=1729702820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>FEEL THE FEATURE OF THE COUNTRY:</strong>.<br>In IFU, every element of the environment contributes to the frightening atmosphere. From an ominous rustle to the flickering light of a lantern, your heart will beat in rhythm with every step in an abandoned mansion where every corner could be hiding your enemy... or a clue... Or a clue.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666080/extras/e5bf3414de79769f7ee11e57b85939b2.poster.avif?t=1729702820\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666080/extras/e5bf3414de79769f7ee11e57b85939b2.webm?t=1729702820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666080/extras/e5bf3414de79769f7ee11e57b85939b2.mp4?t=1729702820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>EXPERIENCE THE BORDERS OF REALISM:</strong>.<br>IFU raises the bar on realism with thoughtful gameplay that forces you to look at simple walking from a new angle. Discretion and attention to detail are your main allies in the search for the truth.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666080/extras/e8d7ac31a142c501101903f18391edaf.poster.avif?t=1729702820\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666080/extras/e8d7ac31a142c501101903f18391edaf.webm?t=1729702820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666080/extras/e8d7ac31a142c501101903f18391edaf.mp4?t=1729702820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>OPEN the veil of secrets:</strong>.<br>Every item, every document in the IFU is a piece of the puzzle that you must assemble to understand the full picture of the horror taking place. Put them together to uncover stories that are only whispered in the shadows.",
    "about_the_game": "<i>Immerse yourself in a world where every step you take could be your last, where the tension grows with every passing moment.  The IFU invites you to guide your character, Alexander, through loops of uncharted mysteries and dark secrets.</i><br><br><strong>Discover a story that takes your breath away:</strong>.<br>You are Alexander, a computer programmer who finds himself at the center of an unimaginable nightmare. Your reality turns into a struggle for survival when you follow an invitation that promises to be the gateway to a new life, but becomes the entrance to hell. Meet the mystical Droseries and uncover Dr. Hatcher's story, which is shrouded in sinister secrets.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666080/extras/5bd01b8a0af797589b47f0b54f519816.poster.avif?t=1729702820\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666080/extras/5bd01b8a0af797589b47f0b54f519816.webm?t=1729702820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666080/extras/5bd01b8a0af797589b47f0b54f519816.mp4?t=1729702820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>FEEL THE FEATURE OF THE COUNTRY:</strong>.<br>In IFU, every element of the environment contributes to the frightening atmosphere. From an ominous rustle to the flickering light of a lantern, your heart will beat in rhythm with every step in an abandoned mansion where every corner could be hiding your enemy... or a clue... Or a clue.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666080/extras/e5bf3414de79769f7ee11e57b85939b2.poster.avif?t=1729702820\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666080/extras/e5bf3414de79769f7ee11e57b85939b2.webm?t=1729702820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666080/extras/e5bf3414de79769f7ee11e57b85939b2.mp4?t=1729702820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>EXPERIENCE THE BORDERS OF REALISM:</strong>.<br>IFU raises the bar on realism with thoughtful gameplay that forces you to look at simple walking from a new angle. Discretion and attention to detail are your main allies in the search for the truth.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666080/extras/e8d7ac31a142c501101903f18391edaf.poster.avif?t=1729702820\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666080/extras/e8d7ac31a142c501101903f18391edaf.webm?t=1729702820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666080/extras/e8d7ac31a142c501101903f18391edaf.mp4?t=1729702820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>OPEN the veil of secrets:</strong>.<br>Every item, every document in the IFU is a piece of the puzzle that you must assemble to understand the full picture of the horror taking place. Put them together to uncover stories that are only whispered in the shadows.",
